Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.63,0:00:03.61,Note,,0,0,0,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.77,0:00:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sammy受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy's hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他伤得很严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hurt real bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这条祈祷面向所有能听得到的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one goes out to any angel with their ears on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我是Dean Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.77,0:00:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,先告诉我你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start with a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.53,0:00:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ezekiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.17,0:00:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我有办法治好你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a chance I can fix your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.88,0:00:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么治\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.59,0:00:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以在自己疗伤的同时 治愈Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heal Sam while healing myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.69,0:00:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam可以随时驱逐我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam can eject at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,如果Sam驱逐了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if Sam does eject me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.51,0:00:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那咱们就把这事儿保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we keep it a secret for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.67,0:00:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我只希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got to hope that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're one of those good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.06,0:00:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Zeke\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.33,0:00:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,救救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna bring her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,就像你救活了Cass那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you did with Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.85,0:00:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot keep doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.81,0:00:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,每次我使用能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I use my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.18,0:00:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,都会削弱我的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It weakens me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.11,0:00:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.26,0:00:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸想让我们继续他未竟的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad wants us to pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,帮助别人 杀魔除怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving people,hunting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.85,0:00:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,家族事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}The family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Becky 我写的都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky,it's all real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那是胸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nipples.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:00:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们居然猎杀怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,come on,we hunt monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.16,0:00:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么会在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.19,0:01:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,正常人看见怪物会撒腿就跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,normal people they see a monster and they run.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.23,0:01:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但咱们不可以 不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not us...no,no,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.33,0:01:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们睁着眼睛往虎口里钻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We search out things that want to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.60,0:01:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这是真的 是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's real,it's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.24,0:01:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你的死期到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.73,0:01:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道什么人才这么干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who does that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.58,0:01:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,神经病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.52,0:01:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我是蝙蝠侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.74,0:01:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们脑子有病\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.86,0:01:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我把鞋丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛只剩下一分二十秒了 现在是62比54\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with a 1:20 left in the game,it's 62-54.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.66,0:01:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这一队很想获得冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}This team wants that championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.68,0:01:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他得分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.68,0:01:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了 但是裁判吹哨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good,but the ref's on the whistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.62,0:01:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他犯规了 应该是撞人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's calling a foul.It could be charging.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.01,0:01:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,十号 他可能对此不开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number 10,he's not happy about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.58,0:01:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙可能会被罚出场\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy just about could foul out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.56,0:01:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,除了裁判没人希望他被罚出场\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nobody but the ref wants to see that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Johnson教练看着时钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coach Johnson watching the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.98,0:01:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他要求暂停\N{\fnArial\fs30}He calls time-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.89,0:01:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,正在跟裁判说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talking to the ref right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,目前这场比赛中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, so far in this game
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.42,0:01:52.85,Note,,0,0,0,,(权利的游戏)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.85,0:01:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一名球员被裁判\N{\fnArial\fs30}There have been a number of fouls called.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.11,0:01:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,罚出场 而这不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}By this particular ref,and that's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.80,0:02:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,别大惊小怪 Colonel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy,Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.76,0:02:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,谁在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.85,0:02:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,每次都能吓着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gets me every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.14,0:02:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter,boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.73,0:02:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.76,0:03:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.99,0:03:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.35,0:03:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.45,0:03:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他刚给自己灌了水牛奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just poured some buffalo milk down his gob.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.25,0:03:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,两杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.39,0:03:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,水牛奶吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buffalo milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.55,0:03:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,对的 宿醉良药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.Hangover cure-all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,里面什么都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got everything in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,就是没有水牛奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except buffalo milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.83,0:03:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他还没恢复过来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that kid still recovering from Branson.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.53,0:03:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我能说什么 那小子太新手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say,he's a amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.73,0:03:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,就在餐厅里喝的那两杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The slippery nipple shot at the.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.51,0:03:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,差点儿要了他的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dolly Parton Dixie Stampede nearly killed the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.77,0:03:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.79,0:04:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到了点儿东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,I got something that's gonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.47,0:04:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,能让咱回归老本行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us back on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,案子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.33,0:04:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.20,0:04:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定你准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you're ready for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.13,0:04:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么没准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I not be ready for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.88,0:04:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是一直精神不大好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you kind of running on empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.05,0:04:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但是在过去的3天里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,but the last three nights straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.50,0:04:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我每天都能睡8个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had eight hours of shut-eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.65,0:04:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,对于一个猎人来说 这简直超神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for a hunter,that's like 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.00,0:04:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}And trust me,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.09,0:04:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那真是太好了 James Brown\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,that's great and all,James Brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.52,0:04:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但你还没从试炼里恢复过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're still recovering from the trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.16,0:04:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你应该慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you ought to pace yourself,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你恢复得越快\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the sooner you heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.43,0:04:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.05,0:04:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想让你早日恢复以前的状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want you back to your old self.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.43,0:04:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.11,0:04:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.04,0:04:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin现在恢复正常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin's back on the heaven stoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.15,0:04:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley被咱们关起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley's locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们应该做回自己的老本行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be out there doing what we do best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.28,0:04:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底想不想听\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to listen at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.12,0:04:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,动物标本制作商\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxidermist named Max Alexander.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.95,0:04:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Max Alexander 被神秘撞死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mysteriously crashed to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.44,0:04:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,身体几乎被完全肢解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nearly every joint in his body dislocated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.29,0:04:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,全身骨骼破裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every bone broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.83,0:04:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,完全变成了椒盐脆饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor guy's a human pretzel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.19,0:04:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,来说说什么东西能做到这种程度\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me what's got that kind of strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.46,0:04:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,神奇的墨西哥摔角选手\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demonic Luchador.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.53,0:04:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那家店离咱们就几小时车程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shop's a couple hours away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,就在俄克拉荷马州的伊尼德 至少去查看一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Enid Oklahoma,we should at least check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.09,0:04:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你有充分的理由证明不应该去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless there's some reason you think we shouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:05.00,Note,,0,0,0,,(动物标本店 提供邮寄)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.28,0:05:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,真精致\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.63,0:05:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真是越来越诡异了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The creep factor just skyrocketed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.94,0:05:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}How're ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.65,0:05:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Michaels探员和Deville探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Michaels and Deville.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.89,0:05:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体已经被送去太平间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Body's already been to the morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.41,0:05:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,刚跟Dave Stephens聊过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wrapping up with Dave Stephens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.07,0:05:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是他发现了尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the one who discovered the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.08,0:05:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前和Max一起打猎呢 真遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a shame,I used to go hunt with Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.42,0:05:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他人很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's real good egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.72,0:05:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,节哀顺变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry for your lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.83,0:05:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你不介意带我搭档四处查看一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind showing my partner around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.40,0:05:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我有几个问题要问Stephens先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got a couple questions for Mr.Stephens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.23,0:05:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.47,0:05:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你是Dave Stephens吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,Dave Stephens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.24,0:05:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你可以的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got a couple questions for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.11,0:05:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我有几个问题要问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.74,0:05:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把你想知道的都告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you whatever you need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.67,0:05:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Max他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max was a.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.70,0:05:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是个非常好的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}A real pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.60,0:06:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,结伴打猎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunting buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.94,0:06:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么时候发现尸体的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So about what time did you discover the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,早上9点左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}About nine a. m.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.90,0:06:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是我提货的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}At my usual pickup time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我每周三和周日\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come in every Wednesday and Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.84,0:06:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,都回来收内脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}To collect the entrails.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,收什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The what.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.75,0:06:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,动物器官\N{\fnArial\fs30}The animal organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Max把尸体剖开\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Max would dig'em out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.56,0:06:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,然后制作标本\N{\fnArial\fs30}And work his magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.56,0:06:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个艺术家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a real artist,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.74,0:06:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不过奇怪的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange thing is,though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.90,0:06:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,今天早上垃圾桶是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bins were empty this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is that strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.34,0:06:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,因为今天是周日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause it's a Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.13,0:06:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,周末打猎 在这片区域来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weekend hunts are pretty much a.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.93,0:06:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,基本上是大丰收\N{\fnArial\fs30}Given in the neck of the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.32,0:06:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,所以垃圾箱应该塞满内脏才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they're usually chock-full of guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.54,0:06:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有可能是Max自己已经清理过了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any chance Max could have cleaned them out himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.11,0:06:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.75,0:06:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那东西有的有毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a biohazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.32,0:06:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能就这么轻易把它们清理干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just,you know,throw the stuffs out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.99,0:06:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,得用火烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to burn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.89,0:06:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,店里有没有其他东西报失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything else missing from the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.70,0:07:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,外来人员登记很完整 保险箱完好无损\N{\fnArial\fs30}The register was full and safe was intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Max所有的作品都完好的待在墙上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all of Max's trophies were still on the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.27,0:07:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,除了你还有别人来过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were there anybody else here when you showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.15,0:07:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.01,0:07:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,other than.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.06,0:07:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,除了 Colonel\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.38,0:07:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,失陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.99,0:07:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.82,0:07:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们找到了个喜欢收集动物器官的贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,so we got a thief who's jonesing for animal parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.19,0:07:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a pagan symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.57,0:07:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一块人肉卷饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get a human pretzel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.81,0:07:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 这事儿很像是巫师干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,it all sounds very witchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.47,0:07:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我没找到任何巫术袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I wasn't able to find a hex bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 咱们再继续查一查\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,well,let's keep digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.39,0:07:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.19,0:07:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.12,0:07:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢它看着我的眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't like the way that one's looking at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.46,0:07:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.22,0:07:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那个涂鸦并不是巫术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Symbol in the graffiti,it's not wiccan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,其实是个商标\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's copywritten.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.92,0:07:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,当地动物权益保护协会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Local Animal-Rights Group.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.88,0:08:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,伊尼德对PETA(善待动物组织)的回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid's answer to PETA.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.63,0:08:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,S. N. A. R. T.\N{\fnArial\fs30}S. N. A. R. T.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.41,0:08:04.01,Note,,0,0,0,,(善待所有生物)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.24,0:08:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,一群动物保护主义者跟标本制作商有仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes sense that an animal-rights group.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.96,0:08:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这事儿还挺容易理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would have an axe to grind with a taxidermist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.27,0:08:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.48,0:08:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那些动物本来就死了呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}The animal's already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.83,0:08:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样没错 但是猎人们可以继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,but hunters are what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.64,0:08:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,支持着整个行业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep them in business.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.42,0:08:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,现在的问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the question is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.56,0:08:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这帮动物保护主义者到底是巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are those bleeding hearts actually witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.70,0:08:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,还是一帮乱涂鸦的小混混\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or just hippies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.68,0:08:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么区别吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the difference
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.91,0:08:26.70,Note,,0,0,0,,(和谐地球 素食烘烤店)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.47,0:08:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道万恶之源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always knew I'd find the source of all evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.98,0:08:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,会潜伏在素食店里\N{\fnArial\fs30}At a vegan bakery.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.45,0:08:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,什么味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.04,0:08:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,广藿香\N{\fnArial\fs30}A patchouli.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.43,0:08:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,混合着因为缺少肉食而产生的怨气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mixed with depression from meat deprivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.44,0:08:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.82,0:08:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,知道什么人才在室内戴墨镜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who wears sunglasses inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.10,0:08:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,盲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blind people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,和傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And douchebags.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.31,0:08:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是Olivia\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.15,0:08:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,和Dylan Camrose吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Dylan Camrose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.14,0:08:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么能帮助您的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}At your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.47,0:09:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是S. N. A. R. T. 的成员吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are remembers of S. N. A. R. T.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.75,0:09:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 是组织者和联合主席\N{\fnArial\fs30}Founders and co-presidents actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.71,0:09:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有兴趣拿点儿资料看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we interest you in some literature.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.22,0:09:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,或者来一块亚麻籽司康饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a flaxseed scone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.73,0:09:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,零谷物 零面粉 零糖分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's wheat-free,gluten-free,sugar-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.77,0:09:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 而且非常多汁 - 给我打住\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And suprisingly moist - Let me stop you right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是来调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.03,0:09:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Max Alexander的死因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The death of Max Alexander.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.50,0:09:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,当地动物标本制作商\N{\fnArial\fs30}A local taxidermist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.24,0:09:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.37,0:09:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.50,0:09:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.45,0:09:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟是个小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.88,0:09:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他昨晚被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,he's murdered last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.34,0:09:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,S.N.A.R.T.的标志出现在犯罪现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the S.N.A.R.T. logo was found at the crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.59,0:09:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩不会恰好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two wouldn't happen to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,知道些什么内幕吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know anything about that,would you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.75,0:09:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他的业务都是靠猎人搞起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}His business is funded by hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.78,0:09:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,猎人都是一个德性\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know how hunters are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.38,0:09:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,一群自负的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're selfish dicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,禽兽不如\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who define themselves by what they kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.91,0:09:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,作为倡议保护动物一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as animal advocates.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.59,0:09:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无法接受他们的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}We couldn't stand for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.14,0:09:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你们杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.23,0:09:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,当然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.52,0:09:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,S.N.A.R.T.提倡零暴力\N{\fnArial\fs30}S.N.A.R.T. doesn't tolerate violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.00,0:09:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,零暴力就等于\N{\fnArial\fs30}This coming from a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.03,0:09:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,散播恐吓涂鸦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who spray paints death threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.71,0:10:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那只是个提醒而已 我们就是想吓吓他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a scare tactic,we just wanted to spook him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.38,0:10:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但结果我们自己反被吓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out we're the ones who got spooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.94,0:10:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.93,0:10:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.82,0:10:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们俩碰头的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we were tagging the joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们听到了一些动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}We heard this noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.67,0:10:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嘶嘶的叫声\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hissing noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.57,0:10:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们吓坏了 然后跑进了巷子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It freaked us out so we ran out into the alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.31,0:10:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但是有人袭击了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But someone attacked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.31,0:10:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,把梅斯毒气喷进了我们的眼睛里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sprayed us in the eyes with mace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.63,0:10:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但我俩不可能报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's not like we could go to the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.99,0:10:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,所以现在我们看起来像两个傻逼一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now we will look like total douchebags.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.15,0:10:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们在屋子里也戴着墨镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we have to wear sunglasses inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.02,0:10:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,坏死病吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Necrosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.78,0:10:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,细胞组织早亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Premature death of tissues.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.60,0:10:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他们的眼睛才变成了那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why their eyes were all messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.98,0:10:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但并不是因为什么梅斯毒气\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's not caused by mace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.17,0:10:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right then,what cause it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿写着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.11,0:10:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,钝物敲击 射线侵染 毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}A blunt force,radiation,venom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,比如蛇的毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那个标本制作商被勒碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The taxidermist was constricted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.77,0:10:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Olivia和Dylan听到了嘶嘶声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olivia and Dylan heard hissing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.95,0:10:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,然后眼睛被喷洒了液体\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they were sprayed in the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.53,0:10:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}By venom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.81,0:10:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.25,0:11:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们要对付的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we talking here,some sort of a.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.18,0:11:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是一只奇葩蛇精\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freaky-ass snake monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.18,0:11:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.12,0:11:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但是奇怪的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The weird thing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.02,0:11:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,蛇要么是把猎物毒死 要么把猎物勒死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snakes either envenomate or constrict.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.38,0:11:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这两件事不会同时发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No snake does both.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.78,0:11:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那我更正一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.03,0:11:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是巨奇葩蛇精\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freaky ass mega snake monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.12,0:11:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是个Vetala干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That could be a Vetala.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.16,0:11:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 但它们可直接上嘴咬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,but they're not afraid to sink their fangs in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.17,0:11:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,标本制作商身上没有咬痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxidermist was bite-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.19,0:11:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,跟valata习性不符\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't really fit the profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.00,0:11:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.02,0:11:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,打给Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}So call Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.13,0:11:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,让他查查相关资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have him looked some stuff up
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.31,0:11:30.45,Note,,0,0,0,,(伊尼德动物收留中心)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.85,0:11:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是来早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you early.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.65,0:11:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.86,0:13:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.02,0:13:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是香水公司的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you were from a perfume company.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.88,0:13:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.65,0:13:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,有爪痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claw marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.53,0:13:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 警察说所有的猫都不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,cops said all the cats went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.55,0:13:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 昨天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right,so yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.54,0:13:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们对付的是个蛇精\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dealing with some sort of a snake monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.04,0:13:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,今天成了猫咪杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today it's a killer kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.83,0:13:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.83,0:13:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.92,0:13:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这个小家伙怎么这么眼熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does that mutt look familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.51,0:13:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,它是那个标本制作商的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the taxidermist's dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.41,0:14:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 两处犯罪现场它都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's been at both crime scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.79,0:14:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,也许它是嫌疑犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's a suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.96,0:14:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,may.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.25,0:14:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是化兽人 或许是变形怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be a skinwalker,maybe a shapeshifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.42,0:14:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't really look like a monster to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.17,0:14:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,有办法试出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}One way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.04,0:14:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi,boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.39,0:14:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.59,0:14:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,乖哈 不会痛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't gonna hurt at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.42,0:14:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你被伤到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.18,0:14:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.21,0:14:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,可以排除凶手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rule out killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.68,0:14:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你们还需要帮助吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You agents need any further assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.38,0:14:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,警官 我们现在不需要 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer,I think we're okay.Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.86,0:14:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,随时可以找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.98,0:14:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,警官 打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer,excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.48,0:14:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,能借用你的帽子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I borrow your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.29,0:15:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,祝收养成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck getting adopted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.69,0:15:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.25,0:15:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Colonel不是嫌疑犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Colonel is not a suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.69,0:15:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,它是目击证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.35,0:15:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你懂手语吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey boy,you speak sign language.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.51,0:15:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 猴子才懂手语 - 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's monkeys - Eh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.03,0:15:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.18,0:15:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,说出来可能很不可思议\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna sound crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.17,0:15:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我读过一本书 讲一个男的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read this book once about this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.66,0:15:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,在一只狗目击一场凶杀案后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who tried to teach his dog to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.35,0:15:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,教狗说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}After it witnessed a murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.97,0:15:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.19,0:15:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.27,0:15:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他还是写书了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he wrote a book about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.35,0:15:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 他没有我们手上的资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,he didn't have what we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.27,0:15:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin,hey,it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.58,0:15:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么能和狗沟通\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we speak to a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.96,0:15:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,因纽特咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}An Inuit spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.71,0:15:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都知道 学者里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We knew the...man of letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.17,0:15:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,也有爱斯基摩人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had its own Eskimo section.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.06,0:15:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就能跟Colonel无障碍沟通了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it supposed to let us communicate with the Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.89,0:15:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.71,0:15:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,计划是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.14,0:15:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin说这像是某种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin said it's like a sort of a.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.42,0:16:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,人与动物的思想融合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human/animal mind meld.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.70,0:16:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么意思 - 如果成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Meaning - If it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.69,0:16:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就能读懂Colonel的思想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be able to read the Colonel's thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.47,0:16:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.24,0:16:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你 - 你的麻烦已经够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You - You got enough on your plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.46,0:16:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,比如\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.70,0:16:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,比如 你很疲劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like...you're tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.81,0:16:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你还在恢复当中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on the mend,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.69,0:16:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus,you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.17,0:16:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你的胃比较敏感 我们现在最不需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a sensitive stomach,last thing we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.86,0:16:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你来喝这玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is you chucking this stuff up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.37,0:16:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来不算太糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't look so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.59,0:16:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚说错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.40,0:16:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.83,0:16:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deila hér me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.61,0:16:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dag eru nou rar vitur orum.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.74,0:17:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那就赶快开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,let's get this party started.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.61,0:17:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我你知道的所有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me everything you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.35,0:17:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么不说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?Cat got your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.52,0:17:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tough crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.86,0:17:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,给Kevin打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,call Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.42,0:17:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这咒语又不好喝 还一点用都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spell tasted like ass and was a buzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.41,0:17:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这都没影响到你的食欲 真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least it didn't affect your appetite.Geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.71,0:17:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,换台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.39,0:17:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,快换台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.31,0:17:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.54,0:17:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.38,0:17:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你 你别说话 起作用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...shut up!It's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.80,0:17:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧问啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.24,0:17:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.18,0:17:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你管这叫经典摇滚乐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call this classic rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.91,0:17:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他们下一首就会放Styx的歌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next thing you know,they'd be playing Styx.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.04,0:17:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Dennis Deyoung\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Dennis Deyoung?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.37,0:17:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,只不过是朋克而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}A punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.12,0:17:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dennis Deyoung不是朋克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dennis Deyoung is not a punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.69,0:18:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.Roboto是经典\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Mr.Roboto,bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.03,0:18:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么在跟一只狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you arguing with a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.73,0:18:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,争论Styx乐队\N{\fnArial\fs30}About Styx.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.18,0:18:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.37,0:18:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.17,0:18:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那个牛仔帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you trying to tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.15,0:18:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你想告诉我们什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the cowboy hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.43,0:18:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,杀我最好朋友的蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}The douchewheel who killed my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.96,0:18:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,戴了一顶牛仔帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was wearing a cowboy hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.23,0:18:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还杀了长发嬉皮士吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the pothead,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.83,0:18:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.42,0:18:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是同一个人作案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same guy killed both.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.85,0:18:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,问问猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask about the cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.81,0:18:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那些猫去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.72,0:18:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 我不想要这坨纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know - I don't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.28,0:18:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我没看见多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't seen much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.02,0:18:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我那个位置在收养所里又不是最佳观景区\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't exactly have the best view in the orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.53,0:18:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我能闻出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I could smell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.52,0:18:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙身上有生肉的味道 洗洁精的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy reeked of red meat,dishwashing detegent and.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.49,0:18:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,还有万金油的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiger Balm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.97,0:18:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,它说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what's he saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.88,0:18:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,说 那个凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the...guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.89,0:18:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有生肉的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He smelled like ground chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.77,0:18:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,肥皂水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soap suds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.81,0:18:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,老妇霜的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old lady cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.95,0:18:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean 你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,what are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.49,0:18:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.14,0:18:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你笑什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you laughing at.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.75,0:19:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.13,0:19:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,喂喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.93,0:19:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.28,0:19:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,说你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.74,0:19:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,喂喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.90,0:19:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,喂喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.65,0:19:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你别跑 就你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You!You!You.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.55,0:19:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你玩哪儿走 汪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.86,0:19:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ummmm,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得咒语成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the spell worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.66,0:19:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 成功得有些过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fact,I think it worked a little too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.25,0:19:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.20,0:19:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得 你可能 变成狗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you might be a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.36,0:19:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 - 你挠你耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What - You're scratching your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.18,0:19:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,对邮递员吼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're...barking at the mailman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.76,0:19:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,还喜欢把扔出去的东西捡回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You playing fetch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.72,0:19:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.89,0:19:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,汪汪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruh-roh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.50,0:19:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,that...Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.97,0:19:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.55,0:19:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说 这咒语是有副作用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,apparently the Inuit spell has some side effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.98,0:19:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我喝之前怎么不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,it'd have been nice to know before I downed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.32,0:19:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,什么副作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of side effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.92,0:20:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟动物思想融合的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you mind meld with an animal,it's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.15,0:20:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能会表现出 该动物的习性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possible to start exhibiting some of its behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.90,0:20:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,别看我啊 Hoss\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look at me,Hoss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.49,0:20:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,又不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.70,0:20:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有多久会想\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long am I gonna have the urge to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.77,0:20:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,闻屁屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sniff butts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不想闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have the urge to sniff butts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.44,0:20:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.35,0:20:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你真的想 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you really have the - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.79,0:20:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.02,0:20:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin也不知道咒语会持续多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin doesn't know how long it'll last.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.50,0:20:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你也知道 这不属于科学领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like it's exact science,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.76,0:20:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,希望咒语失效之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But hopefully when the spell wears off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.80,0:20:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,副作用也随之而去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So will the side effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.60,0:20:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我要是你 我就不吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't eat that if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.98,0:20:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你真打算吃巧克力整死自己吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chocolate?Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.34,0:20:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where we headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,回收留中心去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to the shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.88,0:20:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,闻线索吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To sniff out more clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.38,0:21:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,还是挖漏掉的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe dig up something we missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.86,0:21:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你要再说犬界的双关\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,one more doggy pun out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.42,0:21:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我就把你阉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna have your nuts clipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.81,0:21:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我不得不跟你说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to break it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.91,0:21:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经寂寞空虚很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sack's emptier than Santa's after Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.68,0:21:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,玩儿我呢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,are you kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.35,0:21:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,滚开 蠢鸽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,dick move,pigeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.69,0:21:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧 脑残\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you,asshat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.61,0:21:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did - What.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.90,0:21:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 我是不是能听懂所有动物的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute,can I hear all animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.64,0:21:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊 动物界的有通用语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup,animals have a universal language.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.87,0:21:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就像世界语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like esperanto.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.47,0:21:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这只就碰上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this one actually caught on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.44,0:21:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我才刚刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm just getting started,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.44,0:21:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我要来个大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brewing a real big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.06,0:21:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你的车过后肯定像糊了一层奶油一样白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet your ride's gonna look sweet in white.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.29,0:21:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它在说什么 - 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's he saying - You.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.80,0:21:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这鸽子脑子有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's being a douchebag.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.97,0:21:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你说谁脑子有问题 脑残\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who you calling douchebag,douchebag.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.32,0:21:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 你这带翅膀的老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,shut it,you winged rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.40,0:21:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哥啊 - 干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dude - What.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.60,0:21:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你就 冷静一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.40,0:21:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,上车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.25,0:21:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈 对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha,that's right,Sally.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.87,0:21:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,找妈妈哭去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go cry to mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.11,0:21:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,够了 你这狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it,you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.23,0:21:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean 快进车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh!Dean!Hey!Get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.61,0:22:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我想把Colonel留在车里会比较好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's probably best to just leave Colonel in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.86,0:22:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.95,0:22:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,窗户都是开着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the windows are open.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.07,0:22:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得我们喜欢那样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think we like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.56,0:22:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.06,0:22:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得就因为窗户是开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think because the windows are open.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.64,0:22:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这就算是某种款待了是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That that's some sort of a treat,huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.23,0:22:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,狗跟我们一起进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,the dog's coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.32,0:22:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,别那么冲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.70,0:22:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,长得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.10,0:22:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.19,0:22:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.90,0:23:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,关于那个戴牛仔帽的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what else can you tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.60,0:23:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你还知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the man with the cowboy hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.04,0:23:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 我看到的不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly,I couldn't see much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.54,0:23:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶的白内障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn cataracts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.98,0:23:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,还没有人付我的手术费\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know no one's going to pay for my surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.82,0:23:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,只不过又是一起伤亡而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just another casualty of the system I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.76,0:23:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我不属于这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't belong here,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.45,0:23:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我是纯种的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pedigreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.33,0:23:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你很快就会出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,I'm sure you'll be out of here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.90,0:23:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,别逗了 我都14岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please,I'm 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.90,0:23:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,祝好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck...Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.80,0:23:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们每天都要清理一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the day they clean these cages.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.71,0:23:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 每天一次 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Once a day - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.75,0:23:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我要吃饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biscuit,Just one biscuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.42,0:23:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我要拉寇儿薇芝的海报和摇滚乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a Raquel Welch poster and a rock hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.04,0:23:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我要摇坏这栅栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm shaking the fence,boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.19,0:23:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我还在摇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still shaking the fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.34,0:23:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我在这 - 我是被陷害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Over here - I was framed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.39,0:23:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.91,0:23:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,基本没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.14,0:23:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没有任何线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not getting any clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.02,0:23:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,只是一堆抱怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just bunch of complaints.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.57,0:23:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 帅哥 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,pretty boy.Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.49,0:23:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,ummm,sorry pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.70,0:23:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天的工作结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.92,0:23:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我什么都看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I saw everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.97,0:24:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你们 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll tell you,but.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.05,0:24:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不是免费的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll cost you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.34,0:24:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait,you kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.33,0:24:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我要被一只狗敲诈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm being extorted by a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.70,0:24:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.75,0:24:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,要什么 希望被带走 还是要品牌世佳的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?Beggin' strips?Snausages.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.08,0:24:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那是婊子才要的好吗 如果我要告密揭发某人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch please.If I'm gonna rat someone out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.03,0:24:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就必须是让我觉得值得的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be worth my while.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.04,0:24:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我要 挠肚子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want...a belly rub.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.21,0:24:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.79,0:24:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你挠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not from you,sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.82,0:24:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,要那个大个子\N{\fnArial\fs30}From that big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.68,0:24:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.32,0:24:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,牛仔帽 皮裤\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cowboy hat,leather pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.68,0:24:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙肯定是还没出柜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude's a totally closet case.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.42,0:24:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,除了他的衣着 还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,what else can you tell me about the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.64,0:24:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,其他什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other than...his outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.24,0:24:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他给猫带了一个粗麻袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was carrying a burlap sack for the cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.82,0:24:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他要猫干什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does he want with the cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.45,0:24:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服 我怎么知道 但是他把猫全带走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atta boy.Hell if I know,but he took all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.77,0:24:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,有一只被他吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for the one he ate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.80,0:24:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.25,0:24:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要找的凶手牙口不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently our guy's a sweet tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.98,0:24:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,小猫咪都不在话下\N{\fnArial\fs30}For kitty cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.58,0:25:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,麻袋上面有写字\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the sack had something written on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.53,0:25:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,上面写的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,what did it say.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.98,0:25:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 我们说好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,come on,we had a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.17,0:25:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟这大个子说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,you tell that to the tall drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.63,0:25:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是他先停下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the one who stopped rubbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.83,0:25:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.74,0:25:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我手都抽筋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand cramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.57,0:25:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,它不吭声了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.29,0:25:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atta boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.22,0:25:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,上面写着前卫餐厅 你走运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It said Avant-Garde Cuisine.Lucky for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.89,0:25:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我看得懂法语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read French.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.28,0:25:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那是主街道上的一家餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a cafe on Main Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.60,0:25:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,宠物不得入内\N{\fnArial\fs30}No dogs allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.73,0:25:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,怪不得他身上有汉堡包味道和洗洁精的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder he smelled like hamburgers and dish soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.12,0:25:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要进城一趟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,we got to go downtown.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.26,0:25:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,显然我们要找的人在餐厅里工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparantly our guy works at a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.20,0:25:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.15,0:25:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,等等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait,wait,wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.26,0:25:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你们确定不收养我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you don't want to adopt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.79,0:25:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不需要 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No thanks.We'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.06,0:25:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,别走 我不会舔脚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,I'm not above licking feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.41,0:25:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 大个子 回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,big'un,come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.62,0:25:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.54,0:25:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.25,0:25:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.22,0:25:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我试过的最舒服的挠挠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best belly rub I ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.27,0:26:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,自由啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.95,0:26:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我给动物管理中心留了个惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left a superise in there for animal control.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.30,0:26:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你还是个傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't peg you for a softy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.88,0:26:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,回家了回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going home,I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.32,0:26:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝儿我回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey I'm coming home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.72,0:26:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I'm coming home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.05,0:26:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,烟肉 烟肉 烟肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bacon!Bacon!Bacon!Bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.05,0:26:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我想问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.65,0:26:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,谁家这么有钱 星期一都不营业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who can afford to be closed on Monday these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.91,0:26:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 杀人的疯子 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A homicide maniac - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.17,0:26:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.41,0:27:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.84,0:27:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chef Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.16,0:27:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think he's our guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.56,0:27:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是乡下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okie town.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.46,0:27:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,很多男的都戴牛仔帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lots of dudes were cowboy hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.87,0:27:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,羟可酮 曲马多 美沙酮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,oxycodone,tramadol,methadone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.17,0:27:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,看来他喜欢舒舒服服的麻木着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess he likes to cook comfortably numb.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.90,0:27:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.77,0:27:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 救命 - 请救救我们 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help us - Please mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.32,0:27:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.82,0:27:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.46,0:27:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好像小孩儿的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound like little kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.87,0:27:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,救命 如果你不救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!If you don't free us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.69,0:27:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 主厨会吃了我们的 - 它说的是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The chef will eat us - She's not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.88,0:27:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.06,0:27:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,吃了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.11,0:27:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你身后的冰箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the refrigerator behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.56,0:27:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 在你身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.65,0:28:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,在冰箱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.11,0:28:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.24,0:28:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,猫头鹰脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Owl brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.52,0:28:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,猎豹肝脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheetah liver.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.72,0:28:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,灰熊心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grizzly heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.08,0:28:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,咒语书\N{\fnArial\fs30}A spell book.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.03,0:28:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,萨满教\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shamanism.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.48,0:28:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,主厨要用巫术来干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the chef doing dabbling with witchcraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.02,0:28:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这里写着 不管你吃下动物的任何器官\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says here,whatever animal organs you ingest.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.29,0:28:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,正确地混合巫毒和香料\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the right mix of hoo doo and spices.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.03,0:28:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你就能暂时获得该动物的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You temporarily gain the power of that animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.28,0:28:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.50,0:28:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你吃了猫头鹰大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're munching on owl brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.29,0:28:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你的脑袋就能转的跟驱魔人一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your head spins around like The Exorcist.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.99,0:28:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.13,0:28:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,可以让你的IQ激增\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bolsters your IQ,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.69,0:28:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,吃下猎豹肝脏就能获得速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat a cheetah liver for speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.97,0:28:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,灰熊心脏获得力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bear heart for strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.33,0:28:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他吃了这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,so if he's chowing down on this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.93,0:28:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就能解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it'd make sense,why he.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.02,0:28:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么会勒死标本制作商\N{\fnArial\fs30}Constricted the taxidermist.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.53,0:28:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,还挠死了收留中心的那个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And clawed the guy in the shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.88,0:28:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,别见怪 为什么会有人想吃你们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,no offense,but why do we want to eat you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.43,0:28:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 呃 我们脊椎可折叠 - 是啊 相信我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh,we have collapsable spine - We do,promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.95,0:28:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.00,0:28:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,狮子肝脏加上鹰的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lion liver plus eagle heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.69,0:28:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,响尾蛇的獠牙加上蟒蛇的膀胱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rattlesnake fangs plus anaconda bladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.51,0:29:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他在混合各种器官\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's mixing ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.01,0:29:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,小声点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoo!Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.06,0:29:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,别嘘我 你安静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shush me!You be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.26,0:29:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我很安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am quite.Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.41,0:29:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.44,0:29:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是卫生局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're from the health department.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.97,0:29:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,过来检查卫生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stopped by for an inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.81,0:29:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道我们有安排检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't aware we had one scheduled.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.28,0:29:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 没有 这才是重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,no,you wouldn't be,that's the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.09,0:29:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不是说你们下班了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides,I thought you're closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.47,0:29:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,下班了呀 不过主厨在进行私人就餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are,Chef's having a private dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.34,0:29:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 他随时会过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact,he'll be here in any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.31,0:29:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那好吧 既然这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,well then,in that case.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.02,0:29:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,关闭厨房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kitchen's shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.23,0:29:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,关闭 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut down?Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.44,0:29:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你们都违反了刑法第八章第十四项条例\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're both in clear violation of penal code 8.14.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.56,0:30:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,出去 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out,come on,get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.55,0:30:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,都给我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.73,0:30:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么事儿会通知你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.30,0:30:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我去前门 你去后门\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,I take the front,you take the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.70,0:30:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都不知道怎么杀死这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know how to kill this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.40,0:30:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,朝他脑袋开一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Empty one of these in his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.43,0:30:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,看看怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what that does.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.36,0:30:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,变色龙 味道也不坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chameleons,aren't that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.78,0:31:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,尝起来有点像鸡肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of taste like chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.78,0:31:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell did you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.21,0:31:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 做什么 - 别装了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do what? - Don't play coy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.25,0:31:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我想知道你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna know what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.57,0:31:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,去他的章鱼鲨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,screw the sharktopus.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.93,0:31:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的主菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my main course.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.18,0:32:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么这里有狗的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does it smell like dog in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.18,0:32:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,味道是从你身上来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That smell's coming from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.65,0:32:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的狗都应该被系上项圈拴起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All dog should be leashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.02,0:32:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你对我弟弟做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.47,0:32:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你弟弟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.63,0:32:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈妈怀你们俩的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was your mom smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.75,0:32:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,到底磕了什么药\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she had you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.49,0:32:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.05,0:32:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,只是在晚饭前小憩一下罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just taking a little cat-nap before dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.71,0:32:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没吃过人类心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never had human heart before.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.32,0:32:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,听说挺难嚼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard it's a bit chewy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.63,0:32:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好我不怎么挑食\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job I'm not a fussy eater.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.77,0:33:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你绝对是有病\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.65,0:33:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,经常有人这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told that once or twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.82,0:33:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 不是指你心理变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,not in the head I.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.56,0:33:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 你确实有点儿变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,you're that,too,but.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.37,0:33:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但我说的是 像癌症那种病\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean sick like cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.83,0:33:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,看来狗真的什么都闻得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,I guess dog really can sniff it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.88,0:33:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,癌症第四期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stage four carcinoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.78,0:33:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你才做了这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's why you're doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.39,0:33:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.35,0:33:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,倒霉到家 决定放手一搏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Draw a short straw,decided to break bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.25,0:33:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,当我被确诊的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when I was diagnosed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.44,0:33:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,正常的治疗过程已经无法治好我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was way past standard treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.90,0:33:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没人能救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one could save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.33,0:33:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,但是有了个波尼族萨满的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then with a help of a Pawnee Shaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.16,0:33:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,以及一张动物园年卡 我找到了疗法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a zoo membership,I found a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.39,0:33:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,只是暂时性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would be the temporally one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.23,0:33:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,癌症总会复发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cancer always came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.18,0:33:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你开始用各种器官做实验吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're starting experimenting with different organs,huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.59,0:33:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,给自己混了一大盘子肉当解药吃是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking a single serving for a combo platter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.34,0:33:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我还能说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.28,0:33:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,结合各种疗法是有效的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Combination therapy works.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.21,0:34:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我变得更强壮 而且效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt stronger,and the effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.71,0:34:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,持续很长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lasted longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.54,0:34:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你就觉得自己可以随意杀人了是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you smoke a few innocent people in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.56,0:34:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,哦没错 因为你自我感觉超级良好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well hell,at least you felt better.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.02,0:34:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我没想杀人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean to kill anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.23,0:34:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,本来没想杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.63,0:34:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果有人挡了我的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if people got in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.94,0:34:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就变成了附带损害品\N{\fnArial\fs30}They became collateral damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.01,0:34:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜你干掉的猎食者已经够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess you've eaten enough predators.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.88,0:34:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,多到自己也开始变成猎食者了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start to become one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.32,0:34:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,人如其食 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're what you eat,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.91,0:34:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,即使你真的通过这样的方式 获得了别人的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think the power you hold over people's lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.07,0:34:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,也无法弥补你本身的缺陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can make up for what you lack in your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.19,0:34:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 狗崽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,dog boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.42,0:34:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我要吃下什么才能打倒你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I need to eat to take you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.48,0:34:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会想这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.08,0:34:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 但我确实想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,but I do want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.09,0:34:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,看 我会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}See,I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.96,0:35:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,引起食欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work up a nice appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.32,0:35:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 我会吃了你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then,I'm gonna eat your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.76,0:35:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我不知道他到底是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean I don't know what the hell he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.81,0:35:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 有那么强大的治愈能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with healing powers like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.03,0:35:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谁在乎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.77,0:35:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我要他治愈的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could cure me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.30,0:35:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,犬科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dog on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.49,0:35:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,都差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.32,0:36:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 狼胜过狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry,wolf trumps dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.47,0:36:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,可能吧 但不能胜过一群狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe,but not a whole pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.38,0:37:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.77,0:37:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,看在上帝份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the love of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.56,0:37:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.85,0:37:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.92,0:37:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Zeke\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.07,0:37:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩随便谁赶紧给我醒一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever the hell you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.82,0:37:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 快醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.90,0:37:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,别逼我舔你脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me lick your damn face.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.77,0:37:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.40,0:37:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.55,0:37:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我们打电话说领养的事的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you called us about adopting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.01,0:37:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}We couldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.90,0:37:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是个小甜甜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you a sweet ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.04,0:37:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,离远点 愚蠢的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off,tofu breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.32,0:37:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定饿坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.58,0:37:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你很幸运 我烤了一些培根狗狗蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky for you,I baked some bacon doggy cupcake.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.69,0:37:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟着这两个人 会拉出芽草的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be pooping wheatgrass with this two.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.71,0:37:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看 我知道他们是嬉皮士怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,I know they are hippie freaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.10,0:38:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们能给你一个好家\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they are going to give you a good home.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.27,0:38:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One you deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.45,0:38:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.98,0:38:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望能带你上路 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish we could take you on the road with this,but.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.57,0:38:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是给狗的好生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no life for a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.36,0:38:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.33,0:38:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我晕车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got car sick anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.15,0:38:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前没敢告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid to tell you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.83,0:38:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我吐你车后座上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I barfed in your back seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.66,0:38:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.17,0:38:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.19,0:38:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我会想你的 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna miss you,buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.52,0:38:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我也会想你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll miss you,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.31,0:38:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便说一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.25,0:38:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,作为一个具有狗的荣誉称号的人 你应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}As an honorary dog,there is something you should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.54,0:38:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,狗其实不是人类最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dogs aren't really man's best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.57,0:38:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.33,0:38:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这听起来像是阴谋论者的论调\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it sounds like a conspiracy theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.07,0:38:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们在这里的真正原因是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the real reason we were put here was to.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.98,0:38:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put here to do what.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.18,0:38:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,you got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.13,0:38:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,咒语现在失效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the spell wears off.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.37,0:38:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.18,0:39:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.99,0:39:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,坏消息是 我会想那个家伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,bad news is I'm gonna miss the flea bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.25,0:39:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好消息是 咒语终于失效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good news is it looks like the spell finally wears off.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.84,0:39:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.55,0:39:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那凶手把你揍得挺惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Stetson man got you pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.61,0:39:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.48,0:39:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.64,0:39:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我在想他说的话 没法停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stop thinking what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.71,0:39:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,算了吧 Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on,Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.37,0:39:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那货脑子有泡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy was out of his freaking gourd.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.87,0:39:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是 但是 我是说 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,but,I mean why.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.58,0:39:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么会那么问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he asked that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.32,0:39:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么想知道我是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did he wanna know what I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.03,0:39:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.65,0:39:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他整个人都不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all jacked up on juice you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.71,0:39:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他被他不能控制的东西附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was possessed by something he couldn't control.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.09,0:39:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.81,0:39:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,失控只是时间问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a matter of time before it completely took over.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.42,0:40:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能跟疯子讲道理 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't reason with crazy,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.04,0:40:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.20,0:40:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.34,0:40:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 Sammy 你没什么可担心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, Sammy, you got nothing to worry about
